RESULT : 0x05 -> outcome 4, the capture path broke. Power-cycle the board - USB out for ten seconds - before running anything else.
         0x06 -> outcome 1, the source exists and is FIXED - this is what #30 needs. Wire it into m9.
         The camera came back: 6/6 good, 6 distinct.
         Split trigger/collect: still one distinct crc32, so the FIFO holds it across a frame's compute

ACROSS BOOTS : this boot's pattern is crc32 1608eb14  (split 1608eb14)
               Power-cycle and run again. Same crc means a fixed source across boots;
               different means fixed only within one, which is still enough for #30
               but not for anything that enrols on one boot and scores on another.
